# Ghost snares, accented 16th hats, an open hat on the and of 4 cut by the next closed hat; pedal hats and a layered clap in bar 3; a tom fill with kick2 in bar 4
@length 4bars

1.1      kick  1/16  v120
1.1      hat-closed  1/16  v90
1.1      crash 1/16  v110
1.1.2    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.1.3    hat-closed  1/16  v80
1.1.4    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.2      snare 1/16  v110
1.2      hat-closed  1/16  v90
1.2.2    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.2.3    hat-closed  1/16  v80
1.2.4    snare 1/16  v30  # ghost
1.2.4    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.3      kick  1/16  v115
1.3      hat-closed  1/16  v90
1.3.2    snare 1/16  v40  # ghost
1.3.2    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.3.3    kick  1/16  v100
1.3.3    hat-closed  1/16  v80
1.3.4    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.4      snare 1/16  v110
1.4      hat-closed  1/16  v90
1.4.2    snare 1/16  v28  # ghost
1.4.2    hat-closed  1/16  v50
1.4.3    hat-open  1/16  v85
1.4.4    snare 1/16  v36  # ghost

