3.1.3    hat-pedal  1/16  v75
3.2      snare 1/16  v110
3.2      clap  1/16  v100
3.2      hat-closed  1/16  v90
3.2.3    hat-pedal  1/16  v75
3.2.4    snare 1/16  v30  # ghost
